<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on UPM Kymmene.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on UPM Kymmene.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants has issued four million American-style call warrants, on UPM Kymmene shares, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    100 FIM		   ISSUE PRICE  13.37 FIM</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.DEC.98		 PAYDATE	13.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  93 FIM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
